    [6665]={name="Hexed Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic' - pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle' - pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6671]={name="Juggernaut Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6675]={name="Tempered Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale' - pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6676]={name="Constable Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale' - pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake' - pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6730]={name="Ironforge Chain",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6773]={name="Gelkis Marauder Chain",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6830]={name="Bonebiter",quality=3,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light' - pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6909]={name="Strike of the Hydra",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai",proc="Chance on hit: Corrosive acid that deals 7 Nature damage every 3 sec and lowers target's armor by 50 for 30 sec."},
    [6953]={name="Verigan's Fist",quality=3,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Test of Righteousness'.",questName="The Test of Righteousness",lore="Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all."},
    [7003]={name="Beetle Clasps",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption' - pick it over the other choices. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
